sangati kaala

  "brahma-swarupa spanda-kriya karma-yukta om-sthita"
  "kshetra-sthita kshetrajna-yukta"
  "prakaasha-poorva thaalam-janaka"

  -- grammatical tense values — kaala IS tense; these are its forms in language
  -- "vartamana kaalam", "bhoota kaalam", "bhavisyat kaalam" (Malayalam grammar)
  "vartamana-kaala-janaka bhuta-kaala-janaka bhavishya-kaala-janaka"
  "vidhi-kaala-janaka sambhavana-kaala-janaka"

done
